WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.770
Lamp for reps. Part one: your screen.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.150
Where everything is, and what it's for.

3
00:00:07.560 --> 00:00:13.030
Go to getlamp.app slash staff, and sign in with the email your admin invited.

4
00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:19.360
Up top is your email, your role, and your link name. This rep's link name is jordan.

5
00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:26.420
Under it are your tabs. Files, Dashboard, Engine leads, Applications, Funders, and Money.

6
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.570
Files is home. Every deal you own lives here.

7
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:33.920
Top right is the bell. A number on it means something new.

8
00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:42.070
Click it to see what's new. Leads that arrived, files that came in, offers that landed. Click one to jump straight to it.

9
00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:44.910
Below the tabs are your two application links.

10
00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:52.510
Link A is the online application. The merchant fills it in step by step, and signs on their phone.

11
00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:58.870
Link B is the same application on one page, like paper. They fill it in and sign right on it.

12
00:00:59.170 --> 00:01:03.540
Either way, the signed file lands in your files, already assigned to you.

13
00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:09.660
Copy puts the link on your clipboard, ready to text. Open shows you exactly what the merchant will see.

14
00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:15.670
Next is Today. It's your to-do list, worked out from your files.

15
00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:19.960
Each item names the file, what's waiting, and the next step.

16
00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:26.540
Draft writes a text, an email, and call notes for that step. You edit them, and send them yourself.

17
00:01:27.110 --> 00:01:33.440
Below Today is your board. Every file you own, plus any file nobody owns yet.

18
00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:37.960
Each column is a stage. Each card is one merchant.

19
00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:44.220
A card shows the owner's first name, how many documents are in, when it was opened, and your last note.

20
00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:50.740
Prefer a table? Click List. Same files, one row each. Kanban brings the board back.

21
00:01:52.600 --> 00:01:57.030
Tick Show declined, withdrawn and closed to see the files that are finished.

22
00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:00.610
That's your screen. Next: working your leads.
